{"4258110":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Down Hell","steam_appid":4258110,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this terrifying first-person action game, take control of an elite soldier sent on a suicide mission: infiltrate a prison laboratory where humanity has lost its way. Inhumane experiments on convicts have unleashed unspeakable horrors, and now you face a desperate fight against deadly mutants and monsters to complete your mission.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors, find vital weapons and resources, and uncover the truth behind forbidden secrets that were never meant to be unearthed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4258110\/extras\/b7d2dc5e743fd16992bca9d96fd03790.poster.avif?t=1780159863\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4258110\/extras\/b7d2dc5e743fd16992bca9d96fd03790.mp4?t=1780159863\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need intelligence, precision, and nerves of steel to survive. Explore dark corridors, find vital weapons and resources, and uncover the truth behind forbidden secrets that were never meant to be unearthed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4258110\/extras\/ed4a3dccc6f3262bc1a130e334665c97.avif?t=1780159863\" width=1560 height=872 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to accomplish your mission, or will you become the next victim of this failed experiment?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Down Hell is a first person horror shooter, mostly action and search items to unlock levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.s